---
import { img } from "../content/images";
---

{/*
  Ana's island sits on a band, mirrored: the text left, the portrait right,
  with the gold rule and the signature. The facts pair (years of experience,
  "1 la 1") waits until the years figure in site.ts is Ana's real number; to
  bring it back, render site.stats.years and the "1 la 1" line under the
  signature in a two-column grid, as the previous layout did.
*/}
<section id="despre" class="section band">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="card about reveal">
      <div class="about__text">
        <h2 class="heading-lg">Bună, sunt Ana</h2>
        <span class="gold-divider"></span>

        <div class="about__copy">
          <p>
            Am început manichiura lucrând pentru prietene și familie, iar de câțiva ani o fac cu seriozitate, pentru tot
            mai multe cliente. Pun suflet în fiecare set de unghii și știu că pot livra un rezultat de care să fii
            mulțumită.
          </p>
          <p>
            Lucrez cu produse de calitate, în condiții de igienă atente, și îmi place să ascult ce își dorește fiecare
            clientă, ca rezultatul să fie exact pe gustul tău.
          </p>
          <p>Dacă vrei unghii îngrijite și un moment doar pentru tine, te aștept în Iezureni.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Signature sign-off: the page's warmest moment, signed in Ana's own
             hand, in the italic Fraunces wordmark face with the gold rule
             under it. -->
        <p class="signature" aria-label="semnat, Ana">
          <span aria-hidden="true">cu drag, Ana</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="slot about__photo">
        <img src={img("ana-portrait")} alt="Portret al Anei" width="800" height="1000" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 25rem;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .about__photo {
    order: 2;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-surface-container-high), var(--color-blush-deep));
  }

  .about__text {
    order: 1;
  }

  .about__copy {
    max-width: 60ch;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  .about__copy p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .about__photo,
    .about__text {
      order: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  /* The sign-off: the italic Fraunces wordmark face, with a gold rule that
     grows in beneath it once the section reveals, like the flourish under a
     handwritten name. The rule is decorative only; the readable text carries
     the meaning. */
  .signature {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-optical-sizing: auto;
    font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 30;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--text-title);
    line-height: var(--text-title--line-height);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .signature span {
    display: inline-block;
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    background-image: linear-gradient(var(--color-gold), var(--color-gold));
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: 0 100%;
    /* Default (no-JS, crawlers): the flourish is fully drawn. Never gate
       visible content on the animation. */
    background-size: 100% 2px;
  }

  :global(.js-reveal) .signature span {
    background-size: 0% 2px;
    transition: background-size 900ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 250ms;
  }

  :global(.js-reveal) .reveal.is-visible .signature span {
    background-size: 100% 2px;
  }

  /* Failsafe force-reveal and reduced-motion both snap to the drawn rule. */
  :global(.js-reveal) .reveal.reveal-now .signature span {
    transition: none;
    background-size: 100% 2px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(.js-reveal) .signature span {
      transition: none;
      background-size: 100% 2px;
    }
  }
</style>
